{
  "_doc": [
    "Shop signs and shop kinds (v7). SHOWCASE ONLY: the brand names and logos below are the ones seen in the reference photos, kept so the model reads like the real square. The engine baseline (tag senado-v6) has none; a game build should swap these for its own signage.",
    "signs: artwork, rendered by scripts/make_shop_textures.py into viewer/assets/signs.png at w x h metres (data/sign_atlas.json holds the atlas rectangles). draw 'text' stacks lines of text (size = share of the sign height, shrunk to fit the width); the other draw kinds are pictures drawn by the script. fill 'cover' stretches a banner over a whole window opening; otherwise a sign keeps its size.",
    "generic: the plain bilingual signs for each kind of shop, picked per bay where no brand is placed.",
    "buildings[].kinds: shop kind per facade edge (one kind, or a list per bay; null keeps the hashed default). Kinds: cosmetics pharmacy jewellery bakery fashion cafe jerky shoes.",
    "buildings[].signs: at = band (on the entablature over the ground floor) | window (storey, bays) | fascia (arcade bays) | lintel (above ground-floor shop openings) | wall (s = share of the edge, z in metres or 'band+x' / 'top-x') | roof (a framed sign standing on the roof edge) | awning (canvas over ground-floor openings). s is the sign centre as a share of the edge length."
  ],
